message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original publishers (see SOURCES.md)."
title: "Kuwait Electricity Open Dataset"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Mizan Energy"
    website: "https://mizan-energy.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmedelshazly27/mizan-kuwait-electricity-data"
url: "https://mizan-energy.com/research/kuwait-electricity-data/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
keywords:
  - Kuwait
  - electricity
  - power generation
  - installed capacity
  - peak load
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Every electricity value extracted from the statistical publications of Kuwait's
  Ministry of Electricity, Water and Renewable Energy (yearbooks 2020-2023, monthly
  books May-July 2025) and Central Statistical Bureau (Environment Statistics
  2013-2024), one row per printed cell with full provenance, plus UNdata consumption
  by sector as a separate secondary table. Missing values are not filled; disagreements
  between documents are recorded, not resolved.
